公季父悼子，是為簡公。簡公，昭子之弟而懷公子也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m050-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m050-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m050-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m050-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m050-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"悼子","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m050-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m050-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m050-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"昭子","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m050-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"懷公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p051","text":"簡公六年，令吏初帶劍。塹洛。城重泉。十六年卒，子惠公立。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m051-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m051-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABABA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p055","text":"孝公元年，河山以東彊國六，與齊威、楚宣、魏惠、燕悼、韓哀、趙成侯并。淮泗之閒小國十餘。楚、魏與秦接界。魏筑長城，自鄭濱洛以北，有上郡。楚自漢中，南有巴、黔中。周室微，諸侯力政，爭相併。秦僻在雍州，不與中國諸侯之會盟，夷翟遇之。孝公於是布惠，振孤寡，招戰士，明功賞。下令國中曰：「昔我繆公自岐雍之閒，修德行武，東平晉亂，以河為界，西霸戎翟，廣地千里，天子致伯，諸侯畢賀，為後世開業，甚光美。會往者厲、躁、簡公、出子之不寧，國家內憂，未遑外事，三晉攻奪我先君河西地，諸侯卑秦、醜莫大焉。獻公即位，鎮撫邊境，徙治櫟陽，且欲東伐，復繆公之故地，修繆公之政令。寡人思念先君之意，常痛於心。賓客群臣有能出奇計彊秦者，吾且尊官，與之分土。」於是乃出兵東圍陜城，西斬戎之獂王。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"齊威","kind":"person","person_id":"uhq_4sb_zzv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"楚宣","kind":"person","person_id":"1tl_xlo_url","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"魏惠","kind":"person","person_id":"bhp_5xd_88r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"燕悼","kind":"person","person_id":"d77_fah_85y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"韓哀","kind":"person","person_id":"clj_4gu_9bw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"趙成侯","kind":"person","person_id":"8nv_485_mex","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0